// Iccios, Cobnertos's son, at the depot forge. Nineteen and afraid to run.
// iccios_ready decides whether he comes on the night escape.
=== start
[flag met_iccios] -> again
~ set met_iccios
He's at the anvil, making nails: a rod of iron, four blows, cut, quench, again. A basket of them at his feet, hundreds. He sees you and the hammer stops halfway up.

"You're Cadurci." His voice is deep and very quiet. "From home." He looks over your shoulder, at the tents, at the gate. "Don't stand there. Hold this." He gives you the tongs, so you'll look like you belong.
-> hub

=== again
[flag iccios_out] -> END
"Hold the tongs," he says, without looking up.
-> hub

